# Directory Structure Standards

## Mandatory Directory Organization

This project follows a strict directory structure. All files MUST be placed in their designated locations.

## Root Structure

```
ai-toolbox/
├── .cursor/rules/      # Cursor AI rules (numbered: 001-, 010-, 100-, 200-)
├── .github/            # GitHub workflows and configurations
├── backend/            # Python FastAPI backend
├── config/             # Shared YAML configuration files
├── deployment/         # Docker and deployment configurations
├── frontend/           # Chrome Extension (Plasmo + React + TypeScript)
├── scripts/            # Build, deployment, and utility scripts
├── CLAUDE.md           # Claude AI assistant documentation
├── CONFIGURATION.md    # Configuration guide
├── README.md           # Project documentation
└── STORY.md            # Project story and context
```

